<title>USA: Multicare Q1 net shr $0.24 vs $0.18.</title>
<headline>Multicare Q1 net shr $0.24 vs $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>THE MULTICARE COMPANIES INC AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					   Three months ended</p>
<p>						    March 31,</p>
<p>					    1996	     1997</p>
<p> Net revenues			$120,057	 168,792</p>
<p>     Net income			 4,716	   7,887</p>
<p>Income per common share assuming</p>
<p>full dilution:</p>
<p>  Net income			     0.18	    0.24</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common shares outstanding</p>
<p>   assuming full dilution	  26,523	  36,111</p>
<p>Note: The company took a non-recurring charge in the 1997 quarter relating to the early conversion of $11 million of its 7 percent Convertible Debentures.</p>
<p>The company's operating earnings per share was $0.27 for the first quarter of 1997 versus  $0.23 for the same quarter the previous year.</p>
</text>
